WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.500
Pay attention to numbers and spelled names — they are said letter by letter..

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:15.500
Catch the signposts: but, however, actually.. If your answer exceeds the word

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:23.500
limit, combine two sentences.. In Task 1, describe trends with varied verbs.. In

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:31.500
Task 1 write a report, not an opinion.. State your position clearly in the first

00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:39.500
body paragraph.. In Task 2, two ideas with two examples are enough.. If silence

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:47.500
falls in Speaking, continue with a simple sentence.. In Part 2 take the full

00:00:48.000 --> 00:00:55.500
minute, jot notes and use word cards.. Do not memorise answers in Speaking; use

00:00:56.000 --> 00:01:03.500
patterns instead..
